# Reflection Prompting

## Objective

Reflection prompting encourages the AI to review and improve its own draft before producing a final answer.

---

## Prompt

```
Draft an answer explaining cloud computing.

Before finalizing your answer, review it for clarity, completeness, and factual correctness. Revise it if needed.
```

---

## Benefits

- Better organization
- Improved completeness
- Reduced omissions
- Higher answer quality

---

## Evaluation

| Criteria | Result |
|----------|--------|
| Clarity | Improved |
| Completeness | Improved |
| Consistency | Improved |

---

## Best Practice

Reflection prompts are useful for long-form explanations, reports, and documentation where quality matters more than speed.
